{"about_the_game":"Experience the short story of Alex and Nic as they share memories with each other while climbing a mountain together for the first time. For years, Alex has been going for climbs, and trying to get Nic to join. Outdoor trips for her always meant renting a live-in recreational vehicle, but she\u2019s leaving her comfort zone and do this one climb. It\u2019s a chance for them to remember their lives together and know why this climb is so important. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt features multiple scenes as they climb through different parts of the mountain to reach the summit. There will be an option to travel up a certain path during the experience, which provide different story elements between the characters.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"502140bc612f629232294debb98924e3a33f69dd.jpg","localized_name":"Gallery","name":"Gallery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/557890/502140bc612f629232294debb98924e3a33f69dd.jpg"},{"icon":"dbedbb0142aafb2ce9db119a8cbe5d49d37af925.jpg","localized_name":"Chained Ridge","name":"Chained Ridge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/557890/dbedbb0142aafb2ce9db119a8cbe5d49d37af925.jpg"},{"icon":"3d2599876591af7ecc376fc877e07cccc18a2632.jpg","localized_name":"Whiteout","name":"Whiteout","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/557890/3d2599876591af7ecc376fc877e07cccc18a2632.jpg"},{"icon":"409751b8fa5bcb709fd49b9ba6709f645b9c6cfd.jpg","localized_name":"Melody","name":"Melody","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/557890/409751b8fa5bcb709fd49b9ba6709f645b9c6cfd.jpg"},{"icon":"71c061745386d27df718e5499ce4c4747d8384a6.jpg","localized_name":"Open Clearing","name":"Open Clearing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/557890/71c061745386d27df718e5499ce4c4747d8384a6.jpg"},{"icon":"efd65eb845c810dc25b579d0c183e173c0053575.jpg","localiz